Error [jet.InvalidStatement]: A re-export's target is written in parentheses
  --> Tests/UI/reexport_parenthesized_target.jet:3:7
    |
  3 | root: (core.math.sqrt)
    |       ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: A re-export names its target as a bare path; in parentheses the line is a constant, and a constant holds a value, not a function or a module
 Fix: Drop the parentheses: `root: core.math.sqrt`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0003
